<title>JAPAN: FOREIGNERS NET BUYERS OF JAPANESE STOCKS IN JULY.</title>
<headline>FOREIGNERS NET BUYERS OF JAPANESE STOCKS IN JULY.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net buyers of Japanese stocks on the Tokyo, Osaka and Nagoya stock exchanges in the month from June 30 to August 1, exchange data showed.</p>
<p>    Total foreign buying	     3.30 trillion yen</p>
<p>    Total foreign selling	    2.56 trillion yen</p>
<p>    Net buying			   0.75 trillion yen</p>
<p>Note - All figures rounded.</p>
</text>
